{"id":"soupc_on","lemma":"soupçon","pos":"noun","rank":3732,"glosses":["suspicion; mistrust","a hint, a tad, a little bit (of something)"],"ipa":"/sup.sɔ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Fr-soup%C3%A7on.ogg/Fr-soup%C3%A7on.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"soupçons"},"examples":[{"text":"Ils n'ont aucun soupçon.","en":"They're not suspicious.","words":[{"g":"they"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"none, no-one"},null]},{"text":"Fais-je l'objet de soupçons ?","en":"Am I under suspicion?","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"faire"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"thing, object"},{"g":"of / from"},null]},{"text":"Les nouvelles ont confirmé mes soupçons.","en":"The news confirmed my suspicions.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"news"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to confirm","l":"confirmer"},{"g":"my"},null]},{"text":"Il est au-dessus de tout soupçon.","en":"He is above suspicion.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"to the"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"all"},null]},{"text":"Son histoire a éveillé mes soupçons.","en":"His story aroused my suspicion.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},{"g":"story"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"awake"},{"g":"my"},null]}]}